an><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt'>S.B.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658240;left:-52px;\r\ntop:754px;width:994px;height:756px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAQDiAwEAgAAAAAAAAAIgRI6py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8cHUAAAOw==\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>ULTRASONOGRAPHY\r\nOF WHOLE ABDOMEN] \u2013 DR. S.B. - MALE \/ FEMALE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>============================================================================<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>LIVER: Span:- _____\u00a0 mm ; AP diameter:- _____\u00a0 mm (approx).\r\nThe parenchymal echopattern is normal. There is no sizeable focal parenchymal\r\nabnormality. Intrahepatic vascular and biliary radicles are not dilated. Left\r\nlobe and caudate lobe appears normal in size.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>GALL BLADDER: Shows physiological distension. The walls are\r\nregular and normal in thickness. Lumen is clear. No sizeable calculus is seen\r\nin the lumen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>PORTA: CBD:- Normal in calibre ( ____\u00a0 mm) and shows clear\r\nlumen. No obvious calculus or SOL noted within. No filling defect seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>PORTAL VEIN:- Measures approx. _____\u00a0 mm (normal).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>PANCREAS: The outline is regular. Echopattern is normal. No SOL\r\nis seen. Pancreatic duct is not dilated. No abnormality is seen in\r\nperipancreatic region.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>SPLEEN: Normal in size, outline and echotexture. No focal\r\nabnormality is seen in the parenchyma. The splenic vein and its tributaries\r\nappear normal.\u00a0 Splenic Span _____ mm (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>KIDNEYS: Right Kidney:- _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm (approx). Left\r\nKidney:- _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Both kidneys are normal in size, shape, outline and position.\r\nThe cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\nechodifferentiation. There is no evidence of cystic lesion, renal calculi or\r\nhydronephrotic changes. Perirenal spaces are clear.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>URETERS: Not dilated hence not visualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>URINARY BLADDER: Prevoid:- Shows normal distension. The walls\r\nare regular. No Calculus \/ Growth \/ Sludge etc are seen in the walls or lumen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Prevoid urinary bladder volume is ____ mls (approx.) <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Postvoid:- Postvoid residual urinary bladder volume is\r\nincreased \/ insignificant [ ____ ml (approx)].<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>UTERUS: Anteverted. Normal in shape and outline. The size is\r\nwithin normal limits (____ x ____ x ____ mm).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Myometrium:- Normal homogenous appearance. No myomatous lesion\r\nis seen. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Endometrium:- Normal in thickness [ ____\u00a0 mm] and brightness.\r\nThe cavity is empty. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Cervix and vagina appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>ADNEXA: The fallopian tubes are not dilated. Both ovaries are\r\nnormal in size and echopattern. No ovarian or adnexal SOL seen. Capsular\r\noutline is preserved. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Right ovary measures _____\u00a0 x ____ mm (approx). Left ovary\r\nmeasures\u00a0 _____\u00a0 x ____\u00a0 mm (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Pouch of Douglas:- Clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>PROSTATE: The size, outline and echotexture appear normal. No\r\nfocal lesion is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>Approx. Size:- _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm. approx. weight:-\r\n_____\u00a0 grams.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>MISCELLANEOUS: No free fluid is seen in peritoneal cavity \/\r\neither pleural space. No retroperitoneal abnormality is seen. Aorta and IVC\r\nappears normal. No enlarged para-aortic lymphnodes seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>ILIAC FOSSAE: No definite abnormality seen. Bilateral psoas\r\nshadows are normal. No obvious collection \/ SOL seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>IMPRESSION: No Significant Abnormality is seen in USG\r\nscanning of Whole Abdomen. <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/i><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/i><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>DR. SOUMITRO BHATTACHARYA<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:6.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>MBBS,\r\nMD (RADIOLO